{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"Somewhere in the depths of the Atlantic an obelisk overlooks 4 graves. The ancient symbol upon it glows brightly, startling a small school of fish nearby. \n\nIn Roanoke, Kiln sleeps slumped against the coffee house. The green flames envelope her once again, causing her to awaken with a gasp. As she gasps for air the flames seem to dive into her open mouth.\n\n(Gift of the Depths. Kiln now can breathe underwater and has a swim speed of 25ft. Also she can cast water breathing once per long rest.)","created_at":"2020-08-08T14:56:34.715000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741671204406165594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"Skitter has only recently begun to understand magic. Only from being around Fabertell, Leaf, and 🎵, honestly. It has manifested thus far as a hopeful thought turned magical action. (Cure wounds is him just wishing the pain away etc) seeing magic stitched out, something he is very adept at at this point in his sewing career, makes perfect sense to him. From now on, this is how Skitter transcribes spells.\n\nBardic inspo: actual little affirmations\nHealing word: \"feel better, friend!\"\nDissonent whispers/vicious mockery: actual insults and thoughts that cut to the core. \nSpeaks with animals: pretending to be that animal for 10 minutes and then all of a sudden they make sense.","created_at":"2020-08-08T17:49:32.437000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-08T17:56:24.518000Z","id":"741714731726929931","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"that person logan","id":"519566652824616973","is_bot":0,"username":"thatpersonlogan"},"author_id":"519566652824616973","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"Wrens time in the cage caused a lot of trauma. She is now claustrophobic.","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:29:36.188000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741724813789364354","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"As Ozgur dons his new Demon armor, he's in a good mood, He spends a few minutes watching, mesmerised by the way the clawed gauntlets extend and retract on command and as he places the magical helm upon his head, he doesn't really give much thought to the disturbing metallic crunching sound as the helmet shifts to accomodate his horns, locking them in place. 𝘗𝘦𝘳𝘮𝘢𝘯𝘦𝘯𝘵𝘭𝘺.","created_at":"2020-08-08T18:51:45.400000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741730388908572804","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ghost Magician","id":"494537794027388928","is_bot":0,"username":"ghostmagician"},"author_id":"494537794027388928","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"Storm is ok physically after being captured by the hags, but he is terrified of what people will think of him. He is holding himself accountable for anything the hags did while impersonating him because he thinks it’s his fault that those things happened because he was captured","created_at":"2020-08-08T19:51:25.481000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741745404856762481","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"This ended up being a bit longer than I thought, but here's some Leaf lore for why she felt so strongly about talking to and freeing the howler today :)\n---\n*\"Goblins are small, black-hearted humanoids that lair in despoiled dungeons and other dismal settings. Individually weak, they gather in large numbers to torment other creatures.\"*\n\nA small goblin tribe many miles from London gets very lucky. They find a promising road with lots of places to hide, to attack and take shinies. The tribe begins to prosper and grow. With more shiny things comes more to protect. More traps. More weapons. The leader grows greedy and instructs the *Gatherers* to begin checking their traps daily. \n\nA small goblin much better suited for picking berries finds that her trap has caught something. A someone. She's never seen anyone like this up close before. They stare at each other wordlessly, the someone with visible fear in their eyes. Before the goblin as a chance to make a decision, her group leader comes to collect their bounty. \n\nThat night, much dancing and shouting is to be had around the fire, while the someone screams out in pain. The *Lashers* whisper among themselves. They take note of the one not dancing.","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:58:42.194000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741852933024514079","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"Meanwhile, another someone notices their loved one did not come home for dinner...\n\nA vengeful spirit is stirred and they begin hunting the goblin tribe in the name of their lost someone. Goblin ears here the cry, fearful eyes see the heavy metal armor, the shiny sword, the powerful *booyahg*. Clearly outmatched, they run, leaving behind anything they don't care for. A few empty tents, some smoldering logs, and a small goblin sleeping beneath a tree.\n\nShe wakes to the sound of heavy metal boots hitting the ground in front of her. A flash of lightning. Splinters flying. Sword swinging. Small feet running. They don't stop running. Neither does the hunter.\n\nThe trees begin to sway. The sky cries water from the ocean. Nature itself spins.\n\nIt keeps spinning and spinning until the once hunted goblin stands in an open field, watching a young howler misty step through the trees. She stands smiling, not running, hoping to break the cycle.","created_at":"2020-08-09T02:58:45.125000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741852945317888092","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
